WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.901
♪♪

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:05.467
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:09.234
President Biden today attended
the White House Easter Egg Roll.

00:00:09.234 --> 00:00:13.133
However, due to inflation, the
kids all had to share one egg.

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:14.534
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.534 --> 00:00:18.334
[ As Biden ]
I'm gonna need that back,
guys, too.

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:21.133
New York mayor Eric Adams
recently tested positive

00:00:21.133 --> 00:00:22.300
for the coronavirus,

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.968
and it's the first
positive result he's had.

00:00:24.968 --> 00:00:26.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.901 --> 00:00:30.067
New Jersey is set this week
to begin allowing the sale

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:32.667
of recreational marijuana,
so now when people drive

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:35.367
into Jersey, instead of,
"What's that smell?"

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:37.801
They'll be saying,
"Ooh, what's that smell?"

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:40.000
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.868
The Florida Department
of Education announced last week

00:00:42.868 --> 00:00:46.334
that the state has rejected
over 50 math textbooks

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:48.934
from next school year's
curriculum due to references

00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:50.701
to critical race theory.

00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:54.634
What kind of word problems
do those books have?

00:00:54.634 --> 00:00:56.601
"If Johnny has to buy 30 apples

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:58.067
for the Black Panther
meetings..."

00:00:58.067 --> 00:01:00.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.234 --> 00:01:02.267
The Boston Marathon
was held today.

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:04.934
It's the only marathon that
starts with someone yelling --

00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:06.501
[ Boston accent ]
"Cops are here!"

00:01:06.501 --> 00:01:09.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.167
A Florida man
was arrested recently

00:01:11.167 --> 00:01:14.968
after authorities found a baby
alligator, firearms, and drugs

00:01:14.968 --> 00:01:16.801
in his car
during a traffic stop,

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:20.133
so they had to cancel
the gender reveal party.

00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:24.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:27.300
Authorities in Spain recently
detained a fishing boat

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:30.100
that was carrying more
than 6,000 pounds of cocaine

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.267
in a fuel tank, which was dumb,

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:35.300
because they could have gotten
way more for the fuel.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.234
The athletic apparel company
Lululemon

00:01:40.234 --> 00:01:43.200
will launch a program this week
where customers can exchange

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.701
their gently used clothing items
for e-gift cards.

00:01:46.701 --> 00:01:49.968
Or, if you prefer cash,
there's always Gary.

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:52.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.534 --> 00:02:01.267
"Oh, hey, before you go
in the store, I'll pay double.

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:05.434
Gently used, super used. Eh.

00:02:05.434 --> 00:02:09.801
Gary's not picky
is what I'm saying."

00:02:09.801 --> 00:02:11.801
And finally, a man in Florida
recently broke

00:02:11.801 --> 00:02:13.934
a Guinness World Record
by watching the movie

00:02:13.934 --> 00:02:16.901
"Spider-Man: No Way Home"
292 times,

00:02:16.901 --> 00:02:19.234
and then set another
world record

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:21.567
by watching "Morbius" twice.

00:02:21.567 --> 00:02:22.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.901 --> 00:02:24.267
♪♪

00:02:24.267 --> 00:02:27.734
In a new interview, the Russian
ambassador to the U.S.

00:02:27.734 --> 00:02:30.234
said that he hasn't talked
to President Vladimir Putin

00:02:30.234 --> 00:02:31.901
since 2017.

00:02:31.901 --> 00:02:34.601
"Yes, you have,"
said a houseplant.

00:02:34.601 --> 00:02:36.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:38.834
After a federal judge
ruled yesterday

00:02:38.834 --> 00:02:40.767
that the CDC mask mandate

00:02:40.767 --> 00:02:42.634
on public transportation
was unlawful,

00:02:42.634 --> 00:02:46.400
New York's MTA announced that it
will still enforce the mandate.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:49.767
However, you are allowed
to briefly pull the mask down

00:02:49.767 --> 00:02:52.868
to smoke weed on the subway car
during the morning rush hour.

00:02:52.868 --> 00:02:55.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:55.434 --> 00:02:57.901
In a new special,
Fox News host Tucker Carlson

00:02:57.901 --> 00:03:01.067
discussed a red-light therapy
called testicle tanning

00:03:01.067 --> 00:03:04.534
that advocates claim
can raise testosterone levels.

00:03:04.534 --> 00:03:07.667
Oh, I think there's a place
on the corner that does that.

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:09.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.901 --> 00:03:12.167
So you should stop by.

00:03:12.167 --> 00:03:13.601
Pretty cool.

00:03:13.601 --> 00:03:16.300
New York City, you know.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.501
Tesla CEO Elon Musk said
in a new interview

00:03:18.501 --> 00:03:19.934
that he does not own a home

00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:21.501
and has just been staying
with friends.

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:23.133
Listen, we know you're lying.

00:03:23.133 --> 00:03:26.000
You're a billionaire.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.434
You don't have any friends.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.434 --> 00:03:32.367
That's right, Elon Musk says
that he does not own a home

00:03:32.367 --> 00:03:33.868
and has just been staying
with friends.

00:03:33.868 --> 00:03:37.601
Man, it's got to be pretty
galling to come home from work

00:03:37.601 --> 00:03:40.133
and the world's richest man
is watching "Jeopardy!"

00:03:40.133 --> 00:03:43.067
and eating your Cheerios.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.067 --> 00:03:46.000
That's like Snoop coming over
to bum some weed.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.501
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.501 --> 00:03:50.534
The New York Daily News
published an op-ed yesterday

00:03:50.534 --> 00:03:53.300
by disgraced former
Governor Andrew Cuomo,

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:56.234
though it was weird
he put that in his byline.

00:03:56.234 --> 00:03:59.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.234 --> 00:04:02.267
According to a new survey,
a quarter of Americans

00:04:02.267 --> 00:04:04.434
said that they would want
a professional biographer

00:04:04.434 --> 00:04:05.934
to write the story
of their life,

00:04:05.934 --> 00:04:09.033
while some literally
can't get them to stop.

00:04:09.033 --> 00:04:11.067
[ Laughter ]

00:04:11.067 --> 00:04:13.067
West Virginia
Senator Joe Manchin

00:04:13.067 --> 00:04:14.200
reportedly told a crowd

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:17.067
at a $5,000-a-plate fundraiser
last month

00:04:17.067 --> 00:04:20.133
that he plans to run
for reelection in 2024.

00:04:20.133 --> 00:04:21.734
Well, I should hope so.

00:04:21.734 --> 00:04:23.734
Although it would be hilarious

00:04:23.734 --> 00:04:26.901
to charge people $5,000
for a chicken cutlet

00:04:26.901 --> 00:04:28.701
and then announce
your retirement.

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:29.534
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.534 --> 00:04:31.167
"Old Joe is goin' fishin'.

00:04:31.167 --> 00:04:33.000
Enjoy the chicken, suckers."

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.467
[ Laughter ]

00:04:34.467 --> 00:04:36.934
And finally,
according to a new survey,

00:04:36.934 --> 00:04:39.834
42% of Americans said
that if they had the chance

00:04:39.834 --> 00:04:41.534
to meet their
favorite celebrity,

00:04:41.534 --> 00:04:42.834
they would ask for a selfie,

00:04:42.834 --> 00:04:45.968
or in my experience,
directions to Times Square.

00:04:45.968 --> 00:04:48.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:48.501 --> 00:04:51.167
"Oh, sure, anything,
anything for a fan.

00:04:51.167 --> 00:04:53.434
Hey, while I'm here,
you want a selfie?

00:04:53.434 --> 00:04:55.133
You don't.
Okay.

00:04:55.133 --> 00:04:56.634
How about I take a picture
of you?

00:04:56.634 --> 00:04:58.667
Just -- No?
Okay.

00:04:58.667 --> 00:05:00.067
Right down there."

00:05:00.067 --> 00:05:01.400
♪♪

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:02.834
According to a new book,

00:05:02.834 --> 00:05:05.868
President Biden proposed
to First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:05:05.868 --> 00:05:08.434
five times before she
agreed to marry him.

00:05:08.434 --> 00:05:11.534
So basically, he proposed
marriage the same way

00:05:11.534 --> 00:05:12.767
he ran for President.

00:05:12.767 --> 00:05:14.434
[ As Biden ]
How about now?

00:05:14.434 --> 00:05:16.968
Okay, how about now?

00:05:16.968 --> 00:05:19.133
A growing number
of top Russian officials

00:05:19.133 --> 00:05:20.734
are reportedly
starting to question

00:05:20.734 --> 00:05:23.367
President Vladimir Putin's
invasion of Ukraine.

00:05:23.367 --> 00:05:26.133
Which means there's about to be
a shrinking number

00:05:26.133 --> 00:05:27.501
of Russian officials.

00:05:27.501 --> 00:05:29.200
[ Laughter ]

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:32.367
Texas Senator Ted Cruz
criticized Disney yesterday

00:05:32.367 --> 00:05:35.534
for opposing Florida's
so-called Don't Say Gay bill,

00:05:35.534 --> 00:05:37.234
and questioned
what kind of content

00:05:37.234 --> 00:05:38.734
the company will now produce,
adding,

00:05:38.734 --> 00:05:40.834
"In every episode now,

00:05:40.834 --> 00:05:44.234
they're gonna have
Mickey and Pluto going at it."

00:05:44.234 --> 00:05:46.801
What are you talking about?

00:05:46.801 --> 00:05:48.267
In every episode?

00:05:48.267 --> 00:05:51.934
You have to build up
to something like that.

00:05:51.934 --> 00:05:55.667
That's season finale stuff.

00:05:55.667 --> 00:05:57.467
The FBI recently arrested a man

00:05:57.467 --> 00:05:59.367
for participating
in the Capitol attack

00:05:59.367 --> 00:06:01.434
after he was turned in
by the driver

00:06:01.434 --> 00:06:03.968
of the Uber he took
after the insurrection.

00:06:03.968 --> 00:06:06.467
Well, that'll teach him
to give 3-star rating.

00:06:06.467 --> 00:06:08.234
[ Laughter ]

00:06:08.234 --> 00:06:11.400
Politico this week published
its first election forecast

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:13.133
for the 2022 midterm cycle.

00:06:13.133 --> 00:06:16.601
Not to be outdone,
Fox New already called it.

00:06:16.601 --> 00:06:18.133
[ Laughter ]

00:06:18.133 --> 00:06:21.300
The fast food chain Popeye's
announced plans yesterday

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:23.133
to launch a flagship
in Times Square.

00:06:23.133 --> 00:06:25.501
Man, I miss the gritty days
of this city,

00:06:25.501 --> 00:06:27.367
when the only place to eat
in Times Square

00:06:27.367 --> 00:06:29.167
was the Olive Garden.

00:06:29.167 --> 00:06:31.234
[ Laughter ]

00:06:31.234 --> 00:06:33.701
And unnamed worker has filed
a labor complaint

00:06:33.701 --> 00:06:36.534
that alleges Nintendo violated
their right to unionize.

00:06:36.534 --> 00:06:38.934
Well, it wouldn't be
the first time they tried

00:06:38.934 --> 00:06:42.267
to sow discord by pitting
tradesmen against each other.

00:06:42.267 --> 00:06:43.834
[ Laughter ]

00:06:43.834 --> 00:06:46.334
According to a new study,
the legalization of marijuana

00:06:46.334 --> 00:06:48.934
lowers the demand
for prescription medication.

00:06:48.934 --> 00:06:51.501
I mean, sure, why go
all the way to Duane Reade

00:06:51.501 --> 00:06:53.267
when you can just go to Dwayne?

00:06:53.267 --> 00:06:56.133
[ Laughter ]

00:06:56.133 --> 00:06:58.901
And finally -- thank you
to my drug dealer, Dwayne,

00:06:58.901 --> 00:07:00.100
for letting me use his picture,
by the way.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.434
[ Laughter ]

00:07:01.434 --> 00:07:02.701
I mean, I guess that's
one of the nice things

00:07:02.701 --> 00:07:05.100
about, you know, the
decriminalization of it all.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:06.701
Two years ago, he'd be like,
"No, man."

00:07:06.701 --> 00:07:08.534
And now he's like, "No, yeah."

00:07:08.534 --> 00:07:10.267
[ Laughter ]

00:07:10.267 --> 00:07:13.968
"I don't know, you can
put my number up, too."

00:07:13.968 --> 00:07:15.367
And finally,
in a new interview,

00:07:15.367 --> 00:07:17.767
the co-founder
of Arizona Beverages said that

00:07:17.767 --> 00:07:21.801
the brand's popular iced tea
will remain priced at 99 cents,

00:07:21.801 --> 00:07:23.868
despite inflation,
which sounds amazing

00:07:23.868 --> 00:07:26.601
until you see how much they've
shrunk their iced cans.

00:07:26.601 --> 00:07:27.534
[ Laughter ]

00:07:27.534 --> 00:07:28.767
♪♪

00:07:28.767 --> 00:07:31.200
After a clip
was released yesterday

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:34.000
of former President Trump
storming out of an interview

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.567
with journalist Piers Morgan,

00:07:35.567 --> 00:07:38.400
a spokesman for Trump
called the preview

00:07:38.400 --> 00:07:41.467
a "pathetic attempt
to revive the career

00:07:41.467 --> 00:07:43.000
of a failed television host."

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.667
Buddy, you're gonna
have to be more specific.

00:07:45.667 --> 00:07:47.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:47.667 --> 00:07:50.033
That's right --
Piers Morgan released
a clip from an interview

00:07:50.033 --> 00:07:51.901
with former President Trump
that he claims will be

00:07:51.901 --> 00:07:54.267
"the most explosive interview
of the year."

00:07:54.267 --> 00:07:57.067
Well, it's certainly
gonna be the sweatiest!

00:07:57.067 --> 00:07:59.000
I mean, look --
He looks like Jigsaw

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:02.334
just told him he has an hour
to name all the state capitals.

00:08:02.334 --> 00:08:04.367
[ Laughter ]

00:08:04.367 --> 00:08:07.300
After the Capitol attack,
Senate Majority Leader --

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:09.167
sorry -- Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:08:09.167 --> 00:08:11.067
reportedly told --
he was the majority at the time.

00:08:11.067 --> 00:08:13.701
[ Laughter ]

00:08:13.701 --> 00:08:16.234
No, he wasn't. Was he?

00:08:16.234 --> 00:08:17.901
After January 6th, was he?

00:08:19.467 --> 00:08:20.767
-Yeah. Before, right?

00:08:20.767 --> 00:08:23.701
-Yeah, but on January -- Oh, no,
he wasn't. You know what?

00:08:23.701 --> 00:08:26.367
I think the important thing
right now is that this

00:08:26.367 --> 00:08:27.601
is good television.

00:08:27.601 --> 00:08:30.501
[ Laughter ]

00:08:30.501 --> 00:08:32.767
Nobody's gonna argue that.

00:08:32.767 --> 00:08:35.634
[ Laughter ]

00:08:35.634 --> 00:08:37.367
After the Capitol attack,

00:08:37.367 --> 00:08:38.968
Senate Minority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:08:38.968 --> 00:08:40.968
reportedly told his advisors
that he thought

00:08:40.968 --> 00:08:43.634
former President Trump was
responsible for the insurrection

00:08:43.634 --> 00:08:45.767
and added,
"The Democrats are going

00:08:45.767 --> 00:08:48.067
to take care
of the son of a bitch for us."

00:08:48.067 --> 00:08:50.734
Oh, come on, Mitch. You've been
around politics for a long time.

00:08:50.734 --> 00:08:53.100
When have the Democrats
ever taken care of anything?

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.567
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:08:54.567 --> 00:08:56.567
Rudy Giuliani appeared on --

00:08:56.567 --> 00:08:59.234
Oh, I'm sorry
you had to find out here.

00:08:59.234 --> 00:09:03.400
[ Laughter ]

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:06.934
Rudy Giuliani appeared on
"The Masked Singer" last night

00:09:06.934 --> 00:09:08.934
in a jack-in-the-box costume

00:09:08.934 --> 00:09:10.767
and sang the song
"Bad to the Bone."

00:09:10.767 --> 00:09:12.734
I mean,
that is just unbelievable.

00:09:12.734 --> 00:09:16.367
Somebody famous was
on "The Masked Singer"!

00:09:16.367 --> 00:09:18.367
[ Laughter ]

00:09:18.367 --> 00:09:20.300
The new CNN+ streaming service

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:23.200
is reportedly shutting down
on April 30th

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.267
after launching
less than a month ago.

00:09:25.267 --> 00:09:26.634
Well, I'm not surprised.

00:09:26.634 --> 00:09:28.868
You already have
a 24-hour news channel,

00:09:28.868 --> 00:09:32.534
and you couldn't even
fill that with news.

00:09:32.534 --> 00:09:35.901
Don't get me wrong.
I'd watch Tucci go anywhere.

00:09:35.901 --> 00:09:38.200
The Trump International Hotel
in Washington, D.C.,

00:09:38.200 --> 00:09:39.968
is set to be sold
in the coming days

00:09:39.968 --> 00:09:42.067
to a Florida-based
investor group

00:09:42.067 --> 00:09:44.467
led by this intriguing
mystery man.

00:09:44.467 --> 00:09:48.000
[ Laughter ]

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:52.534
Disney World on Tuesday lifted
its remaining mask requirements,

00:09:52.534 --> 00:09:55.200
and it is really
freaking out the kids.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:57.467
[ Laughter ]

00:09:57.467 --> 00:09:59.133
[ Applause ]

00:09:59.133 --> 00:10:01.701
Tyranny's over!

00:10:01.701 --> 00:10:03.801
[ Laughter ]

00:10:03.801 --> 00:10:05.934
The organizers
of the Tony Awards

00:10:05.934 --> 00:10:08.133
have issued a warning
to attendees

00:10:08.133 --> 00:10:11.934
that this year's ceremony has
a "strict no-violence policy,"

00:10:11.934 --> 00:10:14.701
which is obviously a response
to that time

00:10:14.701 --> 00:10:17.100
that guy shot
Alexander Hamilton.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:19.701
[ Laughter ]

00:10:21.334 --> 00:10:25.634
People love "Hamilton" so much,
they were, like, "Yeah!"

00:10:25.634 --> 00:10:27.634
A man in Canada
recently discovered

00:10:27.634 --> 00:10:30.100
through a DNA test
that his biological father

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.400
was his former coworker,

00:10:31.400 --> 00:10:34.934
though he probably should've
figured it out sooner.

00:10:34.934 --> 00:10:37.968
[ Laughter ]

00:10:42.801 --> 00:10:44.234
[ Laughter ]

00:10:44.234 --> 00:10:46.067
Just, I like when
I have to wait a second

00:10:46.067 --> 00:10:47.601
'cause it's a reading joke.

00:10:47.601 --> 00:10:51.100
[ Laughter ]

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:52.968
Today was National Tea Day.

00:10:52.968 --> 00:10:55.000
Oh, do you guys want some tea?
In that case...

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:57.767
[ Whispering ]
Wally's getting fired later.

00:10:57.767 --> 00:10:59.000
-Hey!

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:00.634 --> 00:11:02.000
-I'm kidding.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.634
I went to the network brass
and I said,

00:11:03.634 --> 00:11:04.834
"Either he goes or I go!"

00:11:04.834 --> 00:11:07.567
And they're like,
"Have a great day."

00:11:07.567 --> 00:11:09.701
And finally,
according to the latest numbers,

00:11:09.701 --> 00:11:11.701
by this summer,
Netflix is projected to lose

00:11:11.701 --> 00:11:13.200
around 2 million subscribers.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:16.501
To combat this, they're tweaking
the app a little.

00:11:16.501 --> 00:11:18.501
[ Laughter ]

00:11:18.501 --> 00:11:20.834
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:11:20.834 --> 00:11:24.434
